<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Andrew's Game Hub</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b0c10;
      color: #c5c6c7;
    }
    header {
      background: #1f2833;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #66fcf1;
    }
    nav {
      background: #0b0c10;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #c5c6c7;
      margin: 0 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: #66fcf1;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 0 15px;
    }
    .game-card {
      background: #1f2833;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #45a29e;
    }
    .game-card h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #66fcf1;
    }
    .game-card p {
      margin: 5px 0 10px;
    }
    .game-card a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #45a29e;
      color: #0b0c10;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .game-card a:hover {
      background: #66fcf1;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      color: #c5c6c7;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Andrew's Game Hub</h1>
    <p>Play, explore, and share your favorite games.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#featured">Featured</a>
    <a href="#all-games">All Games</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
    <section id="featured">
      <h2>Featured Game</h2>
      <div class="game-card">
        <h2>Minecraft PvP Arena</h2>
        <p>Custom PvP map with bridges, kits, and fast fights.</p>
        <a href="#">Play / Download</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="all-games">
      <h2>All Games</h2>

      <div class="game-card">
        <h2>Parkour Challenge</h2>
        <p>Speedrun parkour with checkpoints and timer.</p>
        <a href="#">Play / Download</a>
      </div>

      <div class="game-card">
        <h2>AFK Jump Machine Showcase</h2>
        <p>Watch redstone contraptions and AFK builds in action.</p>
        <a href="#">Play / Download</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>About This Site</h2>
      <p>
        This is Andrew's game website—built to host maps, mini‑games, and
        cool projects. Add more cards as you create new games.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Andrew's Game Hub
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
